56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_ETV4MH2MGFTW256901M0TEN8ZZ"}],"claims":[{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"target","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_09Z9JY7ZXR46AQRG01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"Retain p95 authorization latency below 20 ms as an internal target for later representative benchmarks, not as a production SLO or customer commitment."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_3N8TRYSME57QB73G01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"A separate 2000-invocation storage probe added 4000 persisted rows and 1413120 bytes after WAL checkpoint, measuring 353.28 bytes per persisted row for this schema and payload."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_F72SPEM1W952JPDC01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"Little's Law relates long-run mean occupancy, arrival rate, and mean time as L=lambda W under its stated conditions; it does not license replacing mean W with p95."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_GPEDM69WX4WBJNFG01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"At 100 events/s, cold p95/p99 end-to-end latency was 4.272/7.392 ms with max queue depth 1; warm p95/p99 was 4.762/7.533 ms with max queue depth 1 and single-worker mean busy ratio 0.317."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_MB04C8B371R06P2B01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"The timestamped local benchmark completed 1728 paced ToolGateway events across 10, 34, and 100 events/s, with three cold and three warm trials per load and a deterministic seed of 20260824."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_P709MHBBY8KQGNW301M0TEN8ZZ","text":"At the 34 events/s planning point, cold end-to-end latency was mean 3.436 ms, p95 4.262 ms, p99 5.295 ms, queue depth max 0; warm was mean 4.008 ms, p95 5.221 ms, p99 11.511 ms, queue depth max 0."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"assumption","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_R4E5NGS6KKD6MFJV01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"The SRC-06 numeric profile is a planning input whose agents, external-call rate, worker count, revocation, fan-out, and production storage assumptions remain unverified outside the explicitly measured local path."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.794Z","goal_id":"goal_8CTE14C6Q2E1TV8801M0TEN900","id":"rclm_VY9GZ9F67K7JV9HF01M0TEN8ZZ","text":"The measured single-process SQLite/WAL path has local headroom at 34 and 100 events/s in this bounded workload, but the result does not validate a distributed worker count or production capacity."}],"current_chain_hash":"c03fe8871048343043ce9823c7707ef82627f173f2327c903b3dacce2882b7c4","evaluations":[{"artifact_chain_hash":"c03fe8871048343043ce9823c7707ef82627f173f2327c903b3dacce2882b7c4","campaign_id":"rcamp_F228J0RKQQ2HN8WG01M0TEN900","created_at":"2026-08-24T17:56:27.802Z","details":{"audit":{"auditor":"agentos-s1-002-independent-verifier","limitations":["The benchmark is a short single-process local SQLite/WAL baseline with deterministic arrivals and a small read handler, not production traffic.","Distributed worker count, external calls, revocation, fan-out, failover, and multi-region behavior remain unverified.","The auditor role is adversarial and process-separated but not an external human or independently operated mod